        | action         | subscription_upgrade    |
        | user_id        | 1                       |
        | previous_plan  | FREE                    |
        | new_plan       | PRO_199                 |
        | trigger        | ecpay_callback          |
        | transaction_id | (對應的 merchant_trade_no) |

