      Then 操作成功                              # tests/features/steps/common_then/success.py:4
      And 資源列表數量應為 3                         # tests/features/steps/resource_lib/readmodel_then/resource_count.py:6

  Rule: 前置（狀態）- 刪除他人資源失敗  # tests/features/11-資源庫管理.feature:24

