        | MNT-001 | 核心數據庫索引優化 | high | ERR-001 | pending |
      When 使用者 "super@certimate.com" 建立維修排程：                    # tests/features/steps/anomaly/commands/create_maintenance_schedule.py:6
        | 欄位              | 值                   |
        | name            | API Gateway 升級      |
        | starts_at       | 2026-05-01T02:00:00 |
        | ends_at         | 2026-05-01T04:00:00 |
        | notify_channels | email,banner        |
        | notify_targets  | all_subscribers     |
        | notify_before   | 24h,1h              |
      Then 操作成功                                                 # tests/features/steps/common_then/success.py:4
      And 系統應排定在 2026-04-30T02:00:00 與 2026-05-01T01:00:00 發送通知 # tests/features/steps/anomaly/aggregate_then/scheduled_notifications.py:8

  Rule: 後置（狀態）- 啟動全站維修模式後所有請求應導向維修頁面  # tests/features/16-異常維修管理.feature:112

