      Then 操作成功                                                # tests/features/steps/common_then/success.py:4
      And 回應應包含 4 個可訂閱方案（FREE、PRO_199、PRO_PLUS_399、ULTRA_1599） # tests/features/steps/pricing/readmodel_then/plans_count.py:6
      And 每個方案應包含：                                             # tests/features/steps/pricing/readmodel_then/plan_fields.py:6
