      Given 一題 AI 題被 3 位不同使用者回報品質問題                  # tests/features/steps/question_retirement/aggregate_given/ai_question_reported.py:16
      When 系統偵測到回報次數達標                               # tests/features/steps/question_retirement/commands/retirement_scan.py:33
      Then 該題的 retired_at 應被立即設定                     # tests/features/steps/question_retirement/aggregate_then/retirement_state.py:75
      And retention_reason 應為 "品質不合格"                # tests/features/steps/question_retirement/aggregate_then/retirement_state.py:24
      And quality_flag 應更新為 "low"                    # tests/features/steps/question_retirement/aggregate_then/retirement_state.py:87

