      When 系統計算下一題的出題策略                            # tests/features/steps/difficulty_progression/commands/calculate_strategy.py:8
      Then 系統不應觸發遞進（未達連續 3 題門檻）                    # tests/features/steps/difficulty_progression/readmodel_then/strategy_response.py:115
      And 下一題仍在 "信託契約" 出題                          # tests/features/steps/difficulty_progression/readmodel_then/strategy_response.py:123

