      Then 考科 "信託業業務人員" 的統一知識樹應包含 5 個節點      # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/readmodel_then/unified_tree.py:26
      And 所有節點的 source_origin 應為 "exam"      # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/readmodel_then/unified_tree.py:39

    Example: 第二次上傳教材 PDF — 增量合併到既有知識樹                        # tests/features/29-知識樹合併對齊.feature:66
