      When 系統執行語意比對                 # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/commands/trigger_merge.py:31
      Then 兩個節點的語意相似度應大於閾值（>= 0.85） # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/readmodel_then/semantic_similarity.py:10
      And 系統應將兩者合併為同一節點             # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/readmodel_then/semantic_similarity.py:22
      And 保留既有名稱 "受託人義務"（主幹優先）      # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/readmodel_then/semantic_similarity.py:32

    Example: 語意不同的節點不應合併           # tests/features/29-知識樹合併對齊.feature:111
      Given 系統中有以下使用者帳號：           # tests/features/steps/auth/aggregate_given/users.py:64
        | 使用者 ID | Email             | 訂閱方案         | 角色          |
        | 1      | admin@example.com | ULTRA_1599   | SUPER_ADMIN |
        | 2      | pro@example.com   | PRO_PLUS_399 | USER        |
      And 系統中有以下考科：                # tests/features/steps/reverse_engineering/aggregate_given/subjects.py:11
        | 考科 ID | 分類 ID | 名稱      |
        | 1     | 1     | 信託業業務人員 |
      Given 既有知識樹有節點 "金錢信託"        # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/aggregate_given/existing_knowledge_tree.py:52
      And 新上傳教材萃取出節點 "不動產信託"       # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/aggregate_given/document_extraction.py:55
      When 系統執行語意比對                # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/commands/trigger_merge.py:31
      Then 兩個節點的語意相似度應低於閾值（< 0.85） # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/readmodel_then/semantic_similarity.py:43
      And "不動產信託" 應作為新節點加入知識樹      # tests/features/steps/knowledge_merge/readmodel_then/semantic_similarity.py:53

